      <div class="ks-num">4C</div>
      <div><h3>Afro-Textured Hair</h3><p>Higher density and tighter coil patterns benefit from longer, more even steam exposure — making hooded steamers the standard recommendation for 4C hair.</p><span class="ks-tag">Hooded steamer · longer sessions</span></div>
